    "sub_name": "程式邏輯與AI應用",
    "sub_ename": "PROGRAMMING LOGIC AND AI APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "應用生成式AI工具或平台於程式語言或i-tool之教學，協助學生瞭解變數宣告、迴圈、邏輯判斷、陣列與子程式等核心概念，除奠定程式邏輯應用及運算思維觀念之外，更讓學生精準應用生成式AI工具或平台建立應用程式(app)。",
    "describe_eh": "Applying generative AI tools or platforms to the teaching of programming languages and i-tools, this course helps students understand core concepts such as variable declarations, loops, logic decisions, arrays, and subroutines. In addition to establishing a solid foundation in programming logic and computational thinking, students will further develop the ability to precisely apply generative AI tools or platforms to build applications (apps).",
